Each file is licensed as stated in its own header (SPDX-License-Identifier
line or license notice). The full text of every license is in the
LICENSES/ directory. This file summarizes the licenses of the files built
into libpowerdna.so / libpowerdna.a (all *.c files, see Makefile.arm) and
the installed headers (*.h). If this summary and a file header disagree,
the file header applies.

This library contains no third-party source code.


